# Which metal reacts first? Same acid, equal metal amounts
#
# Magnesium reacts vigorously, zinc more slowly, and copper refuses for an
# electrochemical reason. The engine computes reaction and heat but not literal
# wall-clock race times or differences in piece surface area.
register lv2
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.1mol
add v1 Mg 0.01mol
measure v1 thermometer
look v1
new beaker
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 HCl 0.1mol
add v2 Zn 0.01mol
measure v2 thermometer
look v2
new beaker
add v3 water 100mL
add v3 HCl 0.1mol
add v3 Cu 0.01mol
measure v3 thermometer
look v3
